   lookup flakes near UTC midnight / in GMT+8. 47h/49h rows sit 1h from the 48h edge on pinned clocks: no flake. The two real-clock spawns in row 5 compare
   fixture state dated 2026-09-17, far outside the window: flake only if a fixture decision ever ages across 2 days between the spawns.
8. ADVISORY (info flow; brief 112-116) Not a confidentiality control: `--sella` is a free argument (main.ts:193) and petitiones are plain files.
